=2 Walkthrough
\**Notice:** This mission is extraordinarily long. It is broken up into 3 paths (hence the name) and any of these paths can be completed in any order, or all simultaneously.
* Speak with {p:Cid} in the {z:Metalworks} to begin the mission. He will offer you a choice of which path to start on but it doesn't matter which you choose since you can do any of them at any time.
** The fastest route to Cid is from {p:Bastok} - {z:Metalworks} - Home Point #1.

