=4 Departures
* After clearing the BC, speak with {p:Cid} in the {z:Metalworks}.
** After clearing the BC, you might want to exit back into {z:Newton Movalpolos} farm a {@i:Gold Key|1684} {i:Gold Key|Gold Key|1684} for everyone in your party as this exit leads directly to the mobs that drop the key with the most accessible spawns.
* Head to {z:Newton Movalpolos} and farm a {@i:Gold Key|1684} {i:Gold Key|Gold Key|1684} for everyone in your party.
** They drop from the Moblins near the {z:Oldton Movalpolos} zone.
** {p:Proto-Waypoint} to Oldton Movalpolos then zone into Newton Movalpolos puts you at the right mobs.
* Head to {z:Mine Shaft #2716|Mine Shaft 2716} (see above for methods of getting there) and trade the {@i:Gold Key|1684} {i:Gold Key|Gold Key|1684} to the shaft entrance to get a cutscene.
** After the cutscene plays, it will send you to the BCNM Exit.
* Return to {p:Cid} once again to finish this path.

----
* If you have completed the other 2 paths ({M:Tenzen's Path|Promathia Mission 5-3/Tenzen's Path|The Pursuit of Paradise}, {M:Ulmia's Path|Promathia Mission 5-3/Ulmia's Path|Where Messengers Gather}), {p:Cid} will give an additonal cutscene and you can move on to the next Chapter: **{M:For Whom the Verse is Sung|Promathia Mission 6-1|For Whom the Verse is Sung}**.

