>Abilities
:* They can each use their job specific abilities, spells, and more importantly Weaponskills with their respective weapons.
:* They also tend to use {p:skillchains|Skillchain} and will team up accordingly.

>Notes
:* All the monsters in the battle have relatively low HP so they can be taken out fairly quickly with decent damage.
:* The problem is their high TP gain and the ability to unleash devastating weaponskills.
:* A well timed {p:Sleepga} at the start should allow everyone to take out one or more of the Mithran Trackers before the others awaken.
:* Kill the pet's master before their corresponding pet, or they will summon another.
:* {m:Shikaree Y} also {p:Counters|Counter}, so melees should attack her from the sides and back.
:* {n:Shikaree X} and {p:Shikaree Z} have {p:Utsusemi} and {s:Blink} respectively.

