* {@i:Opo-opo Necklace|13143} {i:Opo-opo Necklace|Opo-opo Necklace|13143} and {@i:Sleeping Potion|4161} {i:Sleeping Potion|Sleeping Potion|4161}, unless you can use {p:Meditate}
